{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"easter_eggs/menus/15010360_1_1.cn.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/menu_15010360:1:1","lang":"cn","texts":{"menu:10051930:1":{"text":"我们必须要清理那间屋子吗……？","source_cn":"我们必须要清理那间屋子吗……？","status":"matched_runtime_gender_keys_same"},"say:2:1536032001:0":{"text":"就是……就是那间房子。对，就是我手指的那间。","source_cn":"就是……就是那间房子。对，就是我手指的那间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAE95E69E4CCF4A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1536032002:0":{"text":"刚凑近点，闻到一股子奇怪的腐臭味的时候，我就知道没好事……没想到，里面那么……那么……","source_cn":"刚凑近点，闻到一股子奇怪的腐臭味的时候，我就知道没好事...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x682689210A149F6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1536032003:0":{"text":"里面全都是其他士兵的……尸体，可没有一具是完整的。有的被分解，有的……被吃了。","source_cn":"里面全都是其他士兵的……尸体，可没有一具是完整的。有的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0690CD75C1ABA0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1536032004:0":{"text":"有个靠着门死的士兵，他的怀里……怀里还抱着无数的虫卵……","source_cn":"有个靠着门死的士兵，他的怀里……怀里还抱着无数的虫卵……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x166480F78025F645","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1536032005:1":{"text":"快、快别说了……呕……","source_cn":"快、快别说了……呕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28C4361017AD6084","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:menu:10051930:0":{"text":"你们看见什么了？","male":"你们看见什么了？","female":"你们看见什么了？","source_cn":"你们看见什么了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","variant_male_record_index":"273111","variant_female_record_index":"273113"},"say:1:1536033001:1":{"text":"是啊，那些针蝗消失了，这些村庄陆陆续续也得清理出来，准备让民众重新住进来了。","source_cn":"是啊，那些针蝗消失了，这些村庄陆陆续续也得清理出来，准...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA03FAB7C36AF113","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1536033002:0":{"text":"说实话，我们来之前就预想过，村庄内的状况一定不怎么好。","source_cn":"说实话，我们来之前就预想过，村庄内的状况一定不怎么好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40BCA0ABD71FDC4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1536033003:1":{"text":"但没想到，竟然会有如此惨状……","source_cn":"但没想到，竟然会有如此惨状……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8C472ED9815F89A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1536033004:1":{"text":"哎，后续我们还要与死者的亲属交代情况。这……我们可怎么开口啊……","source_cn":"哎，后续我们还要与死者的亲属交代情况。这……我们可怎么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0201BFFD1E7B54D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:menu:10051930:1":{"text":"清理房屋？","male":"清理房屋？","female":"清